# Contact form delivery (Web3Forms).
# 1. Go to https://web3forms.com and enter the inbox that should receive enquiries.
# 2. The access key arrives by email — paste it here as .env (untracked).
# 3. Add the SAME variable in Vercel → Settings → Environment Variables,
#    otherwise production ships the placeholder and the form refuses to send.
PUBLIC_WEB3FORMS_KEY="REPLACE_WITH_WEB3FORMS_ACCESS_KEY"
